

  Frontend Routes for eBook System 
Author

GET /ebooks/author-registration → EbookAuthorRegistrationForm

GET /author/login → AuthorLogin

GET /ebook/dashboard → EbookDashboard

GET /ebook-dashboard → EBookDashboards

GET /ebook/submit → AuthorSubmitManuscript

GET /ebook/my-submissions → AuthorMySubmissions

GET /ebook/:id → ManuscriptDetail

GET /ebook/:id/edit → EditManuscript

GET /ebook/author/draft → AuthorDrafts

GET /ebooks/edit/:id → UpdateEbook (another edit page)

Editor (ProtectedRoute requiredRole="EDITOR")

GET /ebook/editor/screening → EditorScreeningQueue

GET /editor/screening → ScreeningQueue (duplicate listing page)

GET /editor/screening/:id → EditorScreeningDetail

GET /editor/screening-assessment/:id → EditorScreeningAssessment

GET /editor/assigned → AssignedEbooks

GET /editor/rejected → RejectedEbooks

GET /editor/review-summary/:id → ReviewSummary

GET /editor/:id/review-summary → EditorReviewSummary

GET /editor/:id/make-decision → EditorMakeDecision

Reviewer (ProtectedRoute requiredRole="REVIEWER")

GET /reviewer/my-reviews → ReviewerMyReviews

GET /reviewer/:assignmentId → ReviewerReviewDetail

GET /reviewer/review/:id → ReviewDetail (duplicate detail)

GET /reviewer/:assignmentId/submit → ReviewerSubmitReview

GET /reviewer/completed → CompletedReviews

Finance + Production (ProtectedRoute, no requiredRole in your code)

GET /ebook/finance/pending → FinancePending

GET /ebook/production/queue → ProductionQueue

Public Library

GET /ebook/library → PublicLibrary

GET /ebook/library/:id → PublicEbookDetail

✅ These are the only frontend eBook routes currently in your router.

2) Backend API Endpoints for eBook Publishing System (Full ORA Workflow)


A) Auth (eBook module)

POST /api/ebook/register

POST /api/ebook/login

GET /api/ebook/me

B) Author API

Create / Save / Submit

POST /api/ebooks (multipart)

creates ebook + version v1 + optional original file

PUT /api/ebooks/:id

update metadata OR move DRAFT → SUBMITTED

GET /api/ebooks/my

list my submissions (draft+submitted+etc)

GET /api/ebooks/:id

detail (own ebook)

Upload manuscript file

POST /api/ebooks/:id/upload (multipart)

file field: file

optional file_type

Submit revision

POST /api/ebooks/:id/revision (multipart)

file field: file

History

GET /api/ebooks/:id/history

C) Editor API

Screening

GET /api/ebooks/editor/screening

POST /api/ebooks/:id/editor/start-screening

Screening form + assign reviewers

GET /api/ebooks/:id/screening-form

POST /api/ebooks/:id/screening-assessment

can include recommendedAction=SEND_TO_REVIEW + reviewerIds[]

(Optional direct) send-to-review

POST /api/ebooks/:id/editor/send-to-review

Review summary

GET /api/ebooks/:id/review-summary

Decisions

POST /api/ebooks/:id/editor/accept

POST /api/ebooks/:id/editor/request-revision

POST /api/ebooks/:id/editor/reject

POST /api/ebooks/:id/editor/desk-reject

D) Reviewer API

GET /api/ebooks/reviewer/my-reviews

POST /api/ebooks/reviewer/:assignmentId/respond

{ "action": "accept" } OR { "action": "decline" }

POST /api/ebooks/reviewer/:assignmentId/submit

{ recommendation, comments, confidential_comments }

GET /api/ebooks/reviewer/completed (optional if you use it in UI)

E) Finance API (BPC clearance)

GET /api/ebooks/finance/pending

POST /api/ebooks/:id/finance/decision

{ action: "clear"|"waive"|"decline", amount?, currency?, reference?, note? }

GET /api/ebooks/:id/finance (optional)

F) Digital Production + Publish API

GET /api/ebooks/production/queue

POST /api/ebooks/:id/production/upload-final (multipart)

fields: pdf (required), epub (optional), cover (optional)

POST /api/ebooks/:id/production/publish

{ isbn, doi, access_type, embargo_until? }

GET /api/ebooks/:id/publication (optional)

G) Public Library API

GET /api/ebooks/public?q=&page=&limit=

GET /api/ebooks/public/:id

GET /api/ebooks/public/:id/download?type=pdf|epub